{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07491","headline":"客舍喜郑三见寄 · 刘长卿","name":"客舍喜郑三见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客舍逢君未换衣，闭门愁见桃花飞。\n遥想故园今已尔，家人应念行人归。\n寂寞垂杨映深曲，长安日暮灵台宿。\n穷巷无人鸟雀闲，空庭新雨莓苔绿。\n北中分与故交疎，何幸仍回长者车。\n十年未称平生意，好得辛勤谩读书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07491.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07491","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}